---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | pestcontrolcorneliusnc"
  description="Learn about pestcontrolcorneliusnc—local pest control serving Cornelius, NC and the Lake Norman area. Professional, friendly, and focused on practical results."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <section class="bg-primary-700 text-white">
    <div class="container-narrow section-padding">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">About pestcontrolcorneliusnc</h1>
      <p class="text-primary-100 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Local pest control for Cornelius and the surrounding communities. We believe good service starts with listening, inspecting carefully, and recommending only what is truly needed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Who We Are</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          pestcontrolcorneliusnc is a local pest control provider based in Cornelius, North Carolina. We serve homeowners and businesses throughout the Lake Norman area with a straightforward approach: inspect thoroughly, explain clearly, and treat effectively.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our focus is on the pests most common to this region—ants, termites, rodents, cockroaches, mosquitoes, stinging insects, and more. We do not claim to be the largest company or the cheapest option. We aim to be a reliable, professional choice for people who value careful work and honest communication.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you need a one-time treatment for a specific problem or an ongoing plan for year-round protection, we will walk you through the options and help you decide what makes sense for your property and budget.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Our Approach</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 font-semibold text-sm">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Inspection first</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">We look before we treat. Understanding the species, the entry points, and the conditions that support the problem leads to better results.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 font-semibold text-sm">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Clear communication</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">You will know what we found, what we recommend, and why. No jargon, no pressure to buy more than you need.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 font-semibold text-sm">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Practical prevention</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Treatment is only part of the solution. We share simple steps you can take to reduce the chance of problems returning.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Ready to work with us?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Reach out for a free quote. We will discuss your situation and recommend the most practical next step.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
